  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNOPS - Norway for You - Montenegro</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme targeting underdeveloped municipalities. Eligible &#x2013; all public organisations and NGOs. Focus is on socio-economic development. Goals are to improve infrastructure and municipal services as well as support entrepreneurship and employment opportunities.</narrative>
  </description>
